OL,5,G1135 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FClare and Fran welcome their
OL,7,     Frivals to The New Court Hotel in
OL,8,     FUsk, Monmouthshire. At breakfast,
OL,9,     Fthere are pepper problems and
OL,10,     Fmissing mushrooms, and talk turns
OL,11,     Fto tactics.
OL,12,G1210 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FIt's the final day of the
OL,14,     Fcompetition and the B&Bers meet
OL,15,     Ffor one last time to settle some
OL,16,     Fscores and find out how much
OL,17,     Fthey've been paid, before the
OL,18,     Fwinner is announced.
