OL,5,G1550 Four in a Bed
OL,6,     FVisit two is to the Northern Hotel
OL,7,     Fin Brechin, Angus, where hosts
OL,8,     FPawel and Joanna like to go the
OL,9,     Fextra mile. Things start off
OL,10,     Fbrilliantly, but a breakfast
OL,11,     Fbreakdown could be costly.
OL,12,G1620 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FJess hosts the third visit of the
OL,14,     Fweek, at The Kirkstyle Inn in
OL,15,     FDunning, near Perth. She's hoping
OL,16,     Fthat the quirky style will be a
OL,17,     Fhit, but two guests aren't fans of
OL,18,     Fthe open-plan design.
